							},
							"string" : "The following list of methods that exist in GT, but are missing in GemStone and have equivalents in GemStone that are considered close enough for now.\nThe list is formatted originalMethod -> replacementMethod:\n\n'canPerform: aSelector' -> 'canUnderstand: aSelector'\n'includesSubstring: aString' -> 'findPattern: { aString} startingAt: 1'\n'includesSubstring: aString caseSensitive: false' -> 'findPatternNoCase: { aString } startingAt:  1'"
						}
					]
